		Text: Tables
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Column sizes
		Paragraph: One size per column. Fixed sizes (`120`, `40mm`, `25%`) do not change. `auto` takes what its content asks for, and without fractions the leftover goes to the `auto` columns by how much their content measures. `*` and `2*` share what is left over.
